| Replay: runs the first job Mesa (riscos-mesa's V3DTri) sent, from the
| *V3DDump file MesaJob, as sent and with one change at a time. Kit 8:
| then has the firmware turn the V3D's power domain off and on (as Linux
| has the firmware power it) and runs them all again. Nothing else should
| be using the GPU. Each run that hangs takes about 1.3 s.
RMEnsure V3DRender 0.08 RMLoad <Obey$Dir>.V3DRender
RMEnsure V3DRender 0.08 Error V3DRender 0.08 didn't load
V3DPower { >> <Obey$Dir>.Results }
Run <Obey$Dir>.V3DJob replay <Obey$Dir>.MesaJob -o <Obey$Dir>.Results
V3DPower cycle { >> <Obey$Dir>.Results }
Run <Obey$Dir>.V3DJob replay <Obey$Dir>.MesaJob -o <Obey$Dir>.Results
